# ideationData: Events/TEMPLATES, Roadmap and StyleReference are tracked;
# per-event GENERATED output (ideation / art-requirement PDFs, feedback stores,
# generated images) is not.
#
# Roadmap/Roadmap.xlsx carries unreleased event names and launch dates, and
# StyleReference holds shipped game art. Both are only committed because THIS
# REPO IS PRIVATE. If it is ever made public, remove them from the working tree
# AND the git history first.
ideationData/**
!ideationData/Events/
!ideationData/Events/TEMPLATES/
!ideationData/Events/TEMPLATES/**
!ideationData/Roadmap/
!ideationData/Roadmap/**
!ideationData/StyleReference/
!ideationData/StyleReference/**
